      "required_age": 0,
      "is_free": false,
      "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You took a life</strong>, and spent your own rotting in prison for it. Now, dead and standing at heaven's gates, <strong>the angels offer you a deal</strong>: redeem your soul by <strong>destroying Satan's army</strong>. Hell is boiling over — demons are pouring through cursed portals onto Earth, and you're heaven's chosen weapon to stop them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Goat Massacre is a <strong>fast-paced first-person roguelike shooter</strong> set in a peaceful farmland torn apart by hell itself. As cursed portals rip open the earth and unleash Satan's army, you must <strong>slaughter</strong> every last demon and collapse their gateways. Each wave hits harder than the last, but every destroyed portal earns you <strong>sacred relics</strong> from the heavens — divine blessings that stack into godly power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arm yourself and stack holy relics to <strong>build devastating combinations</strong> of strength, speed, and divine abilities. Turn yourself into an unstoppable force and blast those demonic abominations back to the underworld.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shatter enough portals and a tear in reality opens — your path straight to hell and the Devil himself. Face Satan in a final showdown to earn your place in heaven. But <strong>redemption doesn't come easy</strong>. Challenge him again and again for <strong>virtually infinite gameplay.</strong></p>",
      "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You took a life</strong>, and spent your own rotting in prison for it. Now, dead and standing at heaven's gates, <strong>the angels offer you a deal</strong>: redeem your soul by <strong>destroying Satan's army</strong>. Hell is boiling over — demons are pouring through cursed portals onto Earth, and you're heaven's chosen weapon to stop them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Goat Massacre is a <strong>fast-paced first-person roguelike shooter</strong> set in a peaceful farmland torn apart by hell itself. As cursed portals rip open the earth and unleash Satan's army, you must <strong>slaughter</strong> every last demon and collapse their gateways. Each wave hits harder than the last, but every destroyed portal earns you <strong>sacred relics</strong> from the heavens — divine blessings that stack into godly power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arm yourself and stack holy relics to <strong>build devastating combinations</strong> of strength, speed, and divine abilities. Turn yourself into an unstoppable force and blast those demonic abominations back to the underworld.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shatter enough portals and a tear in reality opens — your path straight to hell and the Devil himself. Face Satan in a final showdown to earn your place in heaven. But <strong>redemption doesn't come easy</strong>. Challenge him again and again for <strong>virtually infinite gameplay.</strong></p>",
      "short_description": "A murderer's only shot at redemption. Shatter hell portals, stack divine relics into devastating builds, and descend deeper into hell until you're strong enough to face Satan himself. A roguelike FPS about salvation through overwhelming holy firepower.",
